{"id":"671ff561e9ca6fbf","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-prob2-brownian-motion-code.md","title":"ZFC Prob2 Brownian Motion Code","display":"df-zfc-prob2-brownian-motion-code — ZFC Prob2 Brownian Motion Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob2-brownian-motion-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob2-brownian-motion-code"],"display":"df-zfc-prob2-brownian-motion-code — ZFC Prob2 Brownian Motion Code","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob2-brownian-motion-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-brownian-motion-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob2-brownian-motion-code — ZFC Prob2 Brownian Motion Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a8a0a7253619eec2\" href=\"?note=a8a0a7253619eec2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process\">58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20d69bde348c5967\" href=\"?note=20d69bde348c5967\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration\">58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(B_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\\)</span> (real-valued measurable-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S\\)</span> (Brownian-process predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a8a0a7253619eec2\" href=\"?note=a8a0a7253619eec2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process\">58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S\\)</span> (filtration predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"20d69bde348c5967\" href=\"?note=20d69bde348c5967\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration\">58-df-zfc-prob2-filtration</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2BrownianMotionCode}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2BrownianMotionCode}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}motion\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2BrownianMotionCode}_S(B_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\langle\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\leq\\rangle)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t)\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(B_\\bullet(t);\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}motion\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2BrownianMotionCode}_S(B_\\bullet,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\langle\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\leq\\rangle)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t)\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(B_\\bullet(t);\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(t))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a Brownian process together with a filtration to which it is adapted.</li>\n<li>The Brownian-process predicate is now called with its actual four arguments, and measurability uses the sourced function predicate rather than measurable-cardinal notation.</li>\n<li>The filtration is indexed by the ordered structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\leq\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\leq\\rangle\\)</span>, not by its bare carrier.</li>\n<li>The Brownian-process predicate already includes the ambient probability-space condition; no unattached duplicate predicate is declared here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targe